{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1321827001:1":{"text":"可哀想に……先日亡くなられた男性は、この子の父親だったのですね？","source_cn":"可怜的孩子，前几天遇难的男人是她的父亲吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A29254FFE9875A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321827002:1":{"text":"この子にデューラ様のご加護を、そしてご両親が神のもとで安らかに眠れますように……","source_cn":"愿艾雅保佑她，也愿她的父母在艾雅的国度得享安宁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CE5442AF95C7C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321827003:1":{"text":"感謝する、オグレ殿。この子の両親の遺骨を同じ場所に埋葬してくれるだろうか。","source_cn":"感谢您，奥格列修士，就请您把她父母的骸骨葬在一起吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE2BDC482C39A790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321827004:1":{"text":"分かりました。お二人は教会の墓地に埋葬いたします。葬儀は明朝、私が執り行いましょう。","source_cn":"我知道了。我会将他们安葬在教堂的墓地内。如果可以的话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18A34BEC924B27E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321827005:1":{"text":"ありがとう……","source_cn":"谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x607C8D9152AAD51A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321827006:1":{"text":"よろしく頼む。教会の心遣いに感謝する。","source_cn":"非常感谢，奥格列修士，这件事就劳烦你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB091157742937D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321827007:1":{"text":"私たちも、明日の葬儀には必ず参列するよ。","source_cn":"我们明天早晨会准时来参加葬礼的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33AEF51A8D538899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"修道士のオグレ","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"フェルガルド","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥尔嘉":{"text":"オルカ","source":"奥尔嘉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}